1	// Conversation transcript with stable scroll anchoring: the list follows new
2	// content only while the reader is at the bottom; scrolling up to reread
3	// pins the viewport until they return to the bottom. In the project chat a
4	// turn is one thread item: the person's message, one line for the tool work
5	// the Agent did in reply, then its words; the change log and the lines
6	// where a G-code left the project render after the turn they follow, in the
7	// order they happened. The printer panel keeps a card per call under the message
8	// that called it.
